{
    "title": "Hide And Seek 3D: Who is Daddy",
    "description": "Hide 'N Seek, the good old classic hide & seek game has been transformed into a more fascinating and amazing mobile game. Play either as a seeker or as a hider and build your shelters from cars or office desks, hide in the water, in the hay pile, in the cornfield, in the boss' office and most importantly, push others in the seeker's vision field. Try to be kind though.\r\n\r\nIn this game, you play as the adults in the family to find the naughty child. You can become the thieves to hide from the police or play as the police to hunt down the thieves. Become a prop and hide away somewhere they can\u2019t find you, don\u2019t be in front of the adult\u2019s eyes. What would you turn into? A plant or a book? Become a table lamp and hide before you are caught.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7c HOW TO PLAY \ud83c\udf7c\r\n- Play as daddy, uncle, mom, police, clown, find and catch people\r\n- Play as baby, run and hide away from adult\r\n- Use joystick to move and box to hide\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE:\r\n- Fun, relaxing and addictive\r\n- Cool reward for winners\r\n- Beautiful and unique 3D visuals\r\n- Play either as seeker or hider\r\n\r\nGet ready for the baby epic hide & seek battle? Download the game Hide And Seek 3D: Who is Daddy now",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hide &#39;N Seek, the good old classic hide &amp; seek game has been transformed into a more fascinating and amazing mobile game. Play either as a seeker or as a hider and build your shelters from cars or office desks, hide in the water, in the hay pile, in the cornfield, in the boss&#39; office and most importantly, push others in the seeker&#39;s vision field. Try to be kind though.<br><br>In this game, you play as the adults in the family to find the naughty child. You can become the thieves to hide from the police or play as the police to hunt down the thieves. Become a prop and hide away somewhere they can\u2019t find you, don\u2019t be in front of the adult\u2019s eyes. What would you turn into? A plant or a book? Become a table lamp and hide before you are caught.<br><br>\ud83c\udf7c HOW TO PLAY \ud83c\udf7c<br>- Play as daddy, uncle, mom, police, clown, find and catch people<br>- Play as baby, run and hide away from adult<br>- Use joystick to move and box to hide<br><br>GAME FEATURE:<br>- Fun, relaxing and addictive<br>- Cool reward for winners<br>- Beautiful and unique 3D visuals<br>- Play either as seeker or hider<br><br>Get ready for the baby epic hide &amp; seek battle? Download the game Hide And Seek 3D: Who is Daddy now",
    "summary": "Hide and seek between father and newborn baby, Find or be found. Up to you.",
